# Verification

After substantive TS/TSX or config edits:

1. `pnpm format:check` (or format the touched files)
2. `pnpm lint` (includes module boundaries)
3. `pnpm typecheck`
4. `pnpm test` scoped to the package when types/contracts are unchanged; full workspace when `packages/contracts` or shared types change
5. `pnpm --filter @gymos/web build` when web/app/ui/platform change

Do not call work merge-ready if typecheck or the required tests were skipped without saying why.
